            "_key": "de2",
            "_type": "image",
            "alt": "Automatic irrigation system repair in Nessebar",
            "asset": {
              "_ref": "image-574a1c8a8b3d971b43f32277d4d34724c13eb7fb-1000x1000-jpg",
              "_type": "reference"
            }
          },
          {
            "_key": "de3",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de3s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Florial repairs and modernises automatic irrigation systems in Nessebar and nearby areas. We diagnose faults, replace equipment and adapt systems to changing site requirements."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de4",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de4s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "When is a repair needed?"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h4"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de5",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de5s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Mechanical damage: sprinklers and nozzles can be damaged by lawn mowing, incorrect use or weather conditions."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de6",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de6s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Hydraulic issues and installation errors: incorrect calculations, poor-quality components or installation mistakes can cause leaks, valve failures and other faults."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de7",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de7s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Equipment wear: pumps, filters and controllers may need servicing or replacement over time. Service life depends on operating conditions and water quality."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de8",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de8s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Changes to the property: new planting, paths or construction work may require moving sprinklers, adding drip lines or creating new irrigation zones."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de9",
            "_type": "image",
            "alt": "Repairing an automatic irrigation system in Sunny Beach",
            "asset": {
              "_ref": "image-e16271d9cfc389008b2ada2ca48d38148de21d70-1280x1707-jpg",
              "_type": "reference"
            }
          },
          {
            "_key": "de10",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de10s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Benefits of working with Florial"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h4"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de11",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de11s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Professional diagnostics: we check the pump, pipework for leaks, valves, controller and sprinkler layout to identify the cause as well as the symptoms."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de12",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de12s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Quality equipment: we use suitable original components from established manufacturers such as Rain Bird and Hunter where compatible with the system."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de13",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de13s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "System optimisation: we adjust zones, replace worn parts and add equipment while aiming to preserve the existing landscape."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de14",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de14s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Our repair services"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h4"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de15",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de15s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "System diagnostics and identification of dry areas; replacement of nozzles, sprinklers, valves, pumps and controllers; leak and pipe repairs; sprinkler relocation; creation of new zones; adjustment of watering times and intensity; and upgrades to outdated components."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de16",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de16s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Why should faults be fixed promptly?"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h4"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de17",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de17s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Blocked nozzles can create yellow patches in the lawn, a faulty controller can water at the wrong time, and damaged pipes can waste water. Timely repairs help prevent more serious failures and costs."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de18",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de18s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Indicative repair prices"
              }
            ],
            "style": "h3"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de19",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de19s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "The original article listed a minimum repair and maintenance price starting at €75. The final price depends on the work required. Listed tasks include replacing or moving a sprinkler, changing a controller, laying pipework, diagnostics, replacing nozzles, installing or removing a pump, servicing or replacing a solenoid valve, and cleaning filters."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de20",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "de20s",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "The stated minimum excludes travel and materials and was described in the original article as applying on 1 February 2026. Confirm current rates and the scope of work before booking."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "de21",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
